  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4937029,
    "UIName": "Blood Asp",
    "Id": "chassisdef_blood_asp_BAS-P",
    "Name": "Blood Asp",
    "Details": "The \"Creep\" - named for the ability to deliver a deadly barrage as it creeps through the shadows under stealth. Built as a pet project by someone at RISC with too much money and a hate-boner for the Clans, this <i>Blood Asp</i> had a pile of advanced tech bolted to it and was turned inside-out in the image of the Inner Sphere. The \"Creep\" retains the <i>Blood Asp's</i> frontline assault role, albeit with a little more trickery. Keep the front toward the enemy and tape down that trigger block.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.23</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
